    description: "Taint propagation through existing linker edges (wasm_bindgen, tauri_ipc, napi, grpc, pyffi). Callee function summaries consulted at bridge calls. IPC boundaries taint-transparent by default (serialization does not sanitize). Survey serialization libs at IPC boundaries and ensure summaries exist. See ADR-0017 §5."  # b8e7
